  "merger_description": "Coles Group Limited (**Coles**) is an Australian public company (**ASX: COL**) that primarily operates:\n\n* supermarkets nationwide through its subsidiary, Coles Supermarkets Australia Pty Ltd; and\n* retail liquor stores nationwide, trading under the Liquorland, Liquorland Warehouse and Liquorland Cellars brands.\n\nMerenda Group Pty Ltd (**Lessor**) is an Australian private company. The Lessor has engaged Catcorp Pty Ltd as development manager. Catcorp is an Adelaide-based development and construction company established in 1999, with experience delivering commercial and mixed-use projects.\n\nColes has signed a letter of offer with the Lessor for a proposed lease of a Coles supermarket within a new neighbourhood centre at 643 Angle Vale Road, Angle Vale SA 5117 (the\u00a0**Acquisition**).\n\nThe proposed Coles supermarket is anticipated to open around November 2029.",
